.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int] | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/27/code.py:117:def _split_canvas(g: np.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int] | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1818057f/15/code.py:115:      local T detector, but yellow means \"highlight this T\" while green means \"erase this T\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/8/code.py:127:def _split_canvas(g: np.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int] | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:25:#     - `_find_blocks_2x2` 默认每个有意义的 2x2 非背景方块都是发射器；因此新增障碍物必须保持孤立，不能拼出 2x2。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/24/code.py:117:def _split_canvas(g: np.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int] | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/1/code.py:92:def _split_canvas(g: np.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int] | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1818057f/2/code.py:58:#    Designed plus components contain exactly one highlighted '+', while distractors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/3/code.py:106:def _split_canvas(g: np.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int] | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/11/code.py:99:def _split_canvas(g: np.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int] | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/7/code.py:81:def _split_canvas(g: np.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tuple[int, int] | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/eee78d87/43/code.py:212:    - The same small contour now controls the background in a literal but color-inverted way: its shape repeats as black cells across the lattice, while the centered overlay preserves the glyph's source color instead of converting it to a fixed highlight color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a32d8b75/17/code.py:83:def _split_canvas(g: np.ndarray) -> tuple[tuple[int, int], tup